{
  "_help": [
    "Industries the Step 02 workbook filters for. Each key in 'active' becomes one tab, in that order.",
    "A post is kept for an industry when a request phrase (looking for, need, anyone recommend, අවශ්‍යයි ... - built into scripts/lib/service-requests.mjs) points at one of that industry's 'services' in the same sentence.",
    "Terms: plain words or phrases, case-insensitive. End a word with * to match any ending (architect* = architect, architects, architectural). Sinhala/Tamil terms match anywhere in the text.",
    "A term can also be { \"match\": \"...\", \"label\": \"...\" } to show a friendlier name in the sheet.",
    "Optional per industry: 'requests' (extra request phrases) and 'exclude' (extra advert/off-topic phrases that count against a post).",
    "To add an industry: copy an entry under 'industries', give it a new key, fill in its terms, and add the key to 'active'."
  ],
